    <div data-content-type=3D"html" data-appearance=3D"default" data-elemen=
t=3D"main" data-decoded=3D"true"><h3>Product Highlights</h3>
<p><strong>MIT420/2</strong> 50 V, 100 V, 250 V, 500 V and 1000 V + Polariz=
ation Index, Dielectric Absorption Ratio, Variable Test Voltage and result =
storage</p>
<ul>
<li>Insulation testing up to 1000 V and 200 G=CE=A9 range</li>
<li>Stabilised insulation test voltage (New)</li>
<li>Single range, faster continuity testing from 0.01 =CE=A9 to 1 M=CE=A9 (=
New)</li>
<li>600 V Trms AC and DC voltage measurement</li>
<li>Live circuit detection and protection</li>
<li>User variable insulation test voltage from 100V to 1000V (New)&nbsp;dep=
ending on model</li>
<li>Test result storage and Bluetooth=C2=AE downloading depending on model<=
/li>
<li>Rechargeable options for mains and car charging (New)depending on model=
</li>
<li>CAT IV 600 V &amp; IP54</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>MIT420/2</strong> 50 V, 100 V, 250 V, 500 V and 1000 V + Polariz=
ation Index, Dielectric Absorption Ratio, Variable Test Voltage and result =
storage</p>
<p>The MIT400-2 series insulation and continuity testers are designed not j=
ust for Electrical and Industrial, but with an exceptionally wide range of =
applications from electrical installations, cable testing, motor testing, a=
utomotive, ESD, panel building, avionics, maintenance etc.</p>
<p>Insulation testing has been enhanced with feedback controlled test volta=
ges to limit over-voltage to 2%, rather than the industry standard 10-20%.<=
/p>
<p>A variable range has been added to allow any intermediate voltage from 5=
0 V to 1000 V in 10 V steps, where application specific test voltages are r=
equired that do not appear in the standard ranges.</p>
<p>Continuity testing is now significantly faster, and a single auto-rangin=
g 0.01 =CE=A9 to 1.0 M=CE=A9 function replaces the "ohms" and "kOhms" range=
s. Retained are the 200 mA and 20 mA test options.</p>
<p>Replacing the original MIT400 instruments the new units feature a redesi=
gned case, back-stand, and 6 cell battery compartment with separate fuse ac=
cess. All instruments are over-moulded for increased protection and achieve=
 an IP54 weatherproof rating.</p>
<h3>Each Unit Includes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Red/Black Silicone test leads with Probes + Clips</li>
<li>SP5 remote switch probe</li>
<li>Batteries 6 x AA Alkaline</li>
<li>Hard carry case</li>
<li>Calibration certificate</li>
</ul>
